### What date is this data as of?
This data is a snapshot as of **2025-06-30**. Date-relative questions (such as overdue, recent, etc.) are evaluated against that date.

### Which vendors have the most overdue invoices?
As of the 2025-06-30 reporting snapshot, **CloudScale Analytics** has the most overdue invoices with 3. A group of vendors follow with 2 overdue invoices each. This covers all source systems (SAP, Oracle, Baan, Workday) via the vendor summary.



Note: overdue amounts are in the invoices' original currencies (USD, EUR, GBP) and are not converted, so the amount column shouldn't be summed across vendors.

